            "review_title": "Review at Pho Gia Truyen 18A",
            "review_text": "Nutmegtravels\nFrankfurt, Germany115 contributions\n0\nThe BEST pho in Hanoi!\nSep 2017 • Solo\nThis is the best pho in Hanoi, without a doubt. Right in the center of the Old Quarter, this family operation opens at 6am and closes after lunch.\n\nIf you do not get there before 6:30am, expect to wait in line for a seat inside or one of the kiddie stools out front.\n\nYou walk right up to the family assembly line, hand mom the 50,000 VND for one bowl, then stand aside. That is less than $2 for a bowl of the best pho you will ever taste, anywhere!\nRead more\nWritten September 19, 2017",
